#. de: allagisch[a] Jäger
#. fr: chasseur allagois
#. column 2: Allagan hunters
#. column 8: Its aggressive temperament have ensured its place near the top of the food chain, although much of this aggression is directed at its own species. In a sense, the Allagan hunter is its own worst enemy.<br><br>Can only be caught when equipped with an augmented dragonsung fishing rod.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Allagan Hunter
msgctxt "Item:31134:0:0"
msgid "Allagan hunter"
msgstr "аллаганский охотник"

