#. ja: 醸造設備の必需品の材料
#. de: Material[p] für eine Brauereikomponente
#. fr: sac de matériaux pour composants de brasserie
#. column 2: sacks of brewery materials
#. column 8: These raw materials represent the first stage of a rather lengthy and complicated process by which the production of ale somehow expedites the completion of a series of war machines. Rather than stopping to consider the many, many flaws in this plan, you would be better off blindly obeying orders, or so your dwarven companions have conditioned you to believe.<br><br>※Only for use in dwarf society quests.
#. column 9: Brewery Materials
msgctxt "Item:31138:0:0"
msgid "sack of brewery materials"
msgstr "мешок материалов для пивоварни"

