#. column 8: Though the name may seem at first to be an oxymoron, each fragment actually contains magma in liquid form beneath a thin crust. Anyone foolish enough to put one of these shards in their back pocket before sitting down will cause a hole to be burned not only in their breeches, but also the chair on which they sat.<br><br>Can only be gathered during an umbral flare.<br><br>Used in expert crafting recipes.
#. column 9: Grade 3 Skybuilders' Umbral Magma Shard
msgctxt "Item:31318:0:2"
msgid "grade 3 skybuilders' umbral magma shards"
msgstr "Сумрачные осколки магмы небесных строителей III разряда"

#. ja: ディアデム諸島で採れるイシュガルド復興用資材。<br>焔霊風時のみ採集可能<br>[イシュガルド復興事業専用]<br>[高難易度レシピ用]
#. de: Rohmaterial aus dem Diadem für den Wieder<shy>aufbau der Himmelsstadt. (Für Aufträge des Wieder<shy>aufbaus Ishgards.)<br>Kann nur während Feuerseelenwinden gesammelt werden.<br>Zur Herstellung von Expertenrezepten.
#. fr: Une ressource du Diadème destinée au chantier d'Azurée.<br>[Réservé à la recon<shy>struc<shy>tion d'Ishgard]<br>[Pour recette avancée]
#. column 0: grade 3 skybuilders' umbral magma shard
#. column 2: grade 3 skybuilders' umbral magma shards
#. column 9: Grade 3 Skybuilders' Umbral Magma Shard
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:31318:0:8"
msgid "Though the name may seem at first to be an oxymoron, each fragment actually contains magma in liquid form beneath a thin crust. Anyone foolish enough to put one of these shards in their back pocket before sitting down will cause a hole to be burned not only in their breeches, but also the chair on which they sat.<br><br>Can only be gathered during an umbral flare.<br><br>Used in expert crafting recipes."
msgstr "Название может показаться противоречивым, но под тонкой коркой в каждом осколке и правда скрывается жидкая магма. Если перед тем как сесть сунуть такой осколок в задний карман, дыра прожжётся не только в штанах, но и в стуле.<br><br>Можно добыть только во время сумрачной вспышки.<br><br>Используется в экспертных рецептах."

