#. column 2: grade 3 skybuilders' steppe bullfrogs
#. column 8: While one might indeed wonder what a so-called “steppe” bullfrog is doing amidst the floating isles of the Diadem, one might stop to consider whether the creature in question would ask the same question of you.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
