#. ja: 第三次復興用のヤビー
#. de: Federfall-Cherax
#. fr: cherax de restauration (3e phase)
#. column 2: grade 3 skybuilders' cherax
#. column 8: Naturalists particular about nomenclature are quick to note that the plural of “cherax” is, in fact, “cherax,” and not “cheraxes.” More practical-minded anglers are equally quick to note that knowing such trivia will not avail one in avoiding its fearsome pincers.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
#. column 9: Grade 3 Skybuilders' Cherax
msgctxt "Item:31586:0:0"
msgid "grade 3 skybuilders' cherax"
msgstr "Речной рак для восстановления, III"

