#. column 8: Some naturalists posit that, unlike its namesake, the catfish derives a degree of pleasure from having its whiskers tickled. Whether it would still appreciate this gesture when performed by the person who plucked the creature unceremoniously from the sky is another question.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
