#. column 8: It is said that the name of this flying wavekin is derived from the guttural grunting sound it emits as it flies through the sky, an unfortunate trait that rather detracts from its overall elegant visual aspect.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
msgctxt "Item:31595:0:9"
msgid "Grade 3 Skybuilders' Gurnard"
msgstr "Летучий морской петух для восстановления, III"

