#. column 8: What is it that compels the storm chaser to forsake calm and welcoming skies for the danger of raging tempests and crackling thunderbolts? Perhaps it is the same as what stirs adventurers to set forth in search of trials and tribulations to overcome.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
#. column 9: Grade 3 Artisanal Skybuilders' Storm Chaser
