#. de: Feuerspeier
#. fr: poisson follet
#. column 2: flintstrikes
#. column 8: The glow it emits when swimming through the ocean depths is reminiscent of sparks flying from a struck flint. Thankfully, it does not present an actual fire hazard, despite what some may think.<br><br>Can only be caught when equipped with a skysung fishing rod.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Flintstrike
msgctxt "Item:31770:0:0"
msgid "flintstrike"
msgstr "кремнёвка"

#. de: Feuerspeier
#. fr: poissons follets
