msgctxt "Item:31918:0:9"
msgid "Grade 4 Skybuilders' Rope"
msgstr "Верёвка для небостроителей IV степени"

#. ja: 第四次復興用のインク
#. de: Fässchen[p] Himmelsang-Tinte
#. fr: bouteille d'encre de restauration (4e phase)
#. column 2: bottles of grade 4 skybuilders' ink
#. column 8: The grade 4 variety of ink is said to be especially quick-drying, which helps to prevent smudging. Some claim, however, that the ink dries before it even has time to reach the parchment, which does rather defeat the purpose of the ink in the first place.
#. column 9: Grade 4 Skybuilders' Ink
msgctxt "Item:31919:0:0"
msgid "bottle of grade 4 skybuilders' ink"
msgstr "бутылка чернил для небостроителей IV степени"

