#. ja: 第四次復興用のヘンプミルク
#. de: Glas[p] Himmelsang-Hanfmilch
#. fr: verre de lait de chanvre de restauration (4e phase)
#. column 2: bottles of grade 4 skybuilders' hemp milk
#. column 8: “We challenged Ishgardians to taste the difference between hemp milk and a leading dairy-based competitor. Eight in ten participants claimed they tasted exactly the same, while the remainder complained of a stomachache from drinking too much milk.”<br>─Culinarians' Guild researcher
#. column 9: Grade 4 Skybuilders' Hemp Milk
msgctxt "Item:31920:0:0"
msgid "bottle of grade 4 skybuilders' hemp milk"
msgstr "бутылка конопляного молока для небостроителей IV степени"

