msgctxt "Item:31921:0:9"
msgid "Grade 4 Skybuilders' Crate"
msgstr "Ящик небесных строителей IV"

#. ja: 第四次復興用の鉄釘
#. de: Schachtel[p] Himmelsang-Eisennägel
#. fr: poignée de clous de restauration (4e phase)
#. column 2: handfuls of grade 4 skybuilders' nails
#. column 8: In traditional Doman carpentry, the wooden pieces are carefully carved to allow them to snugly interlock and remain steadfast for years to come. In Ishgard, however, the wood is considerably less cooperative, and must have little metal spikes driven through it to stay where it is told.
#. column 9: Grade 4 Skybuilders' Nails
msgctxt "Item:31922:0:0"
msgid "handful of grade 4 skybuilders' nails"
msgstr "Горсть гвоздей небесных строителей IV"

