msgstr "Гвозди небесных строителей IV"

#. ja: 第四次復興用のリベット
#. de: Kiste[p] Himmelsang-Nieten
#. fr: poignée de rivets de restauration (4e phase)
#. column 2: handfuls of grade 4 skybuilders' rivets
#. column 8: Although being covered in rivets tends to make basically anything look a lot more sturdy, the act of driving them in to begin with probably compromises the object's structural integrity to some degree. It certainly has that effect on a person's skull.
#. column 9: Grade 4 Skybuilders' Rivets
msgctxt "Item:31923:0:0"
msgid "handful of grade 4 skybuilders' rivets"
msgstr "Горсть заклёпок небесных строителей IV"

