#. ja: 第四次復興用の鉄環
#. de: Kiste[p] Himmelsang-Eisenringe
#. fr: caisse d'anneaux de métal de restauration (4e phase)
#. column 2: handfuls of grade 4 skybuilders' rings
#. column 8: Those who cannot afford proper metal gauntlets can try threading these metallic rings onto their fingers to produce a similar effect. Just be sure to keep your fists clenched to stop them falling off.
#. column 9: Grade 4 Skybuilders' Rings
msgctxt "Item:31924:0:0"
msgid "handful of grade 4 skybuilders' rings"
msgstr "Горсть колец небесных строителей IV"

