#. fr: bloc de pierre de restauration (4e phase)
#. column 2: grade 4 skybuilders' stones
#. column 8: Since ancient times, man has sought to move exceedingly large blocks of stone from one location to another. In the past, methods such as conveying the material atop a series of rolling logs or ferrying it on extremely buoyant rafts were employed, whereas all it requires these days is one plucky volunteer with bottomless pockets.
#. column 9: Grade 4 Skybuilders' Stone
msgctxt "Item:31940:0:0"
msgid "grade 4 skybuilders' stone"
msgstr "Камень небесных строителей IV"

