#. ja: 第四次復興用の作業着
#. de: Himmelsang-Arbeitsmontur
#. fr: habit de travail de restauration (4e phase)
#. column 2: sets of grade 4 skybuilders' overalls
#. column 8: While it is common for mud, paint, and other stains to collect on overalls, some of the skybuilders have taken to deliberately dirtying their clothing to fool others into thinking they have been hard at work. Since a skybuilder's pay is largely based on their performance, however, those who attempt such tricks are normally left with naught but soiled overalls and empty pockets.
#. column 9: Grade 4 Skybuilders' Overalls
msgctxt "Item:31949:0:0"
msgid "set of grade 4 skybuilders' overalls"
msgstr "Комплект рабочей одежды небесных строителей 4-го разряда"

