#. ja: 第四次復興用のグロースフォーミュラ
#. de: Flasche[p] Himmelsang-Wachstumsformel
#. fr: formule de croissance de restauration (4e phase)
#. column 2: bottles of grade 4 skybuilders' growth formula
#. column 8: There are rumors that claim the remarkable height of Elezen is due to doses of growth formula being slipped into their morning porridge from a young age. Attempts to reproduce such an effect on the Lalafells who willingly volunteered as test subjects have yet to yield results, other than an unnatural aversion to porridge.
#. column 9: Grade 4 Skybuilders' Growth Formula
msgctxt "Item:31951:0:0"
msgid "bottle of grade 4 skybuilders' growth formula"
msgstr "Флакон формулы роста небесных строителей 4-го разряда"

