msgctxt "Item:31952:0:9"
msgid "Grade 4 Skybuilders' Stew"
msgstr "Рагу небесных строителей 4-го разряда"

#. ja: 第四次復興用の特注アイスボックス
#. de: sonderbestellt[a] Himmelsang-Eiskiste
#. fr: glacière sur commande de restauration (4e phase)
#. column 2: grade 4 artisanal skybuilders' iceboxes
#. column 8: Though such a device would seem to have little use in Ishgard, where foodstuffs may be kept chilled simply by placing them outside, the icebox does offer protection from rats and crows. But then again, so would any other type of box.
#. column 9: Grade 4 Artisanal Skybuilders' Icebox
msgctxt "Item:31953:0:0"
msgid "grade 4 artisanal skybuilders' icebox"
msgstr "Заказной ледник небесных строителей 4-го разряда"

